# Preload list for M2U7: the characters its game draws with this face (union over the
# charsets whose font chain uses it: U cs7), plus ASCII.
# Made by: charsetchars.py mi2kor --v5 monkey2 --trs korean.trs --map M2KO.MAP --preset U --hot-faces card,card7,card8 --hot-dir dos
# UTF-8; a line starting with # is a comment; order and line breaks do not matter.
